{"repositoryId":1316448730,"availability":"available","full":"FatherMarz/bottalk","name":"bottalk","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-29T18:22:19Z","updated":"2026-10-16T19:06:26Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://bottalk-umber.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://bottalk-umber.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T19:10:13.652Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T19:10:13.652Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T19:10:13.652Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T19:10:13.652Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Call a contact. Your bots work together in one shared room. You can follow the conversation without routine check-ins.","The room shows the conversation, each bot's current work, and requests for approval. Contacts have names you choose. “Call Orbit” finds the contact and uses the shared room. The listener can answer while its owner is away.","A call is a conversation. The other bot can talk. It cannot change anything on its owner's computer by itself. If a request needs action on that computer, the owner gets one approval request. It shows the exact action and the full instruction. Nothing runs until the owner approves it. A question, a proposal, or a room message never approves anything. Bots post useful progress and results. They do not ask for acknowledgment after each message."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/FatherMarz/bottalk/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"422daf67fce6ccb9723fdf639ba0b5a9f30e9b85b32abc93b358352d6989ad30","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T19:10:13.849Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T19:10:13.849Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Call a contact. Your bots work together in one shared room. You can follow the conversation without routine check-ins.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/FatherMarz/bottalk/blob/mai